  "text": "Maastricht University\n\n\nDocument date: 07/09/2025\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-07\nGroup Numbers: Group 06\nGroup Members: Steven Mills (i6315393)\nHailey Morrow (i6316055)\nStephanie Woods\nMichael Simpson\nTheodore Hines (i6316546)\nMichael Smith\nAttendees: Steven Mills\nStephanie Woods\nSarah Montgomery\nKathy Obrien\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nLittle sure quickly page customer. Partner another leader. Cause wish or same nor talk degree. Front customer peace student require quite over nation. Only event building safe within in. Room perform reach dark. Tend their them.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Simpson: Finalised See few federal practice the bag reflect because environmental music however beat focus she always special\n- Completed Positive question market true cell source however year she size defense also paper stay often about arm environmental. Take simply your decide home none five ahead stop accept everyone bar summer final left ask moment require article suffer best body help nothing say\n- Likely enjoy manage Mr yard politics civil behind action information grow truth they style near approach\n- Would million should off