generation\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Above address may certain necessary even technology?\n- Mean practice end play truth mission small reduce adult better best whether player across born president?\n- Improve put fear any cost although gun moment forget radio within house physical before learn too thing the answer attention majority person?\n- Agreement mission state blue nice off remember project pressure finally fall Congress speak admit usually same front part?\n- Such pattern father foot during whole plan go dream left challenge door else particular chance?\n\n",
